        {
          "id": "aee8eb3a-9d3f-492c-898b-d52eb25891ad",
          "kind": "markdown",
          "markdown": "- **Completion and Undo checked:** [PR 182](https://github.com/ewq100/brn-rust/pull/182) extends the existing desktop journey to confirm completion, verify its saved evidence, and undo that exact change. All 333 desktop tests passed, with one existing ignored test. Independent review passed; automated integration checks remain pending.",
