          "metadata": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "880224ef-8cd0-4093-8e73-a31055808d93",
          "kind": "markdown",
          "markdown": "- **Safeguards and check costs inspected:** bounded Save, preview and recovery audits found no actionable defect in the inspected paths. Measured check timings did not justify removing tests or weakening required checks. Older planning pages now point clearly to current task facts.",
